  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6a17f23e472b143",
      "translationZh": "T2I-Adapter 是一种高效的即插即用模型，可在冻结原始大型文本到图像模型的同时，为预训练的文本到图像模型提供额外引导。T2I-Adapter 将 T2I 模型的内部知识与外部控制信号对齐。我们可以针对不同条件训练各种适配器，实现丰富的控制和编辑效果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50b170af97b5104f",
      "translationZh": "作为同期工作，ControlNet 具有类似功能，并得到了广泛应用。然而，运行它的计算开销可能很高。这是因为，在反向扩散过程的每个去噪步骤中，都需要同时运行 ControlNet 和 UNet。此外，ControlNet 强调复制 UNet 编码器作为控制模型的重要性，这导致了更大的参数量。因此，ControlNet 的规模成为生成过程的瓶颈（规模越大，过程就越慢）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59c53b4166da01c2",
      "translationZh": "在这方面，T2I-Adapters 相比 ControlNets 具有竞争优势。T2I-Adapters 的规模更小，而且与 ControlNets 不同，T2I-Adapters 在整个去噪过程中只需运行一次。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba27daf7ad0e846a",
      "translationZh": "模型类型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "166cfbd5b6effb00",
      "translationZh": "模型参数量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "277a2b5801e2180d",
      "translationZh": "存储空间（fp16）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbe454fb7adad3dc",
      "translationZh": "ControlLoRA（秩为 128）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "012a509597b2d6fc",
      "translationZh": "197.78 M（减少 84.19%）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91536bf85fe620c3",
      "translationZh": "396 MB（减少 84.53%）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ae34d09df6ec5a1",
      "translationZh": "79 M（减少 93.69%）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "311d082eec324d64",
      "translationZh": "158 MB（减少 94%）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4aa7ae5beb76c703",
      "translationZh": "过去几周，Diffusers 团队与 T2I-Adapter 的作者们一直在合作，为 diffusers 引入面向 Stable Diffusion XL (SDXL) 的 T2I-Adapters 支持。在这篇博文中，我们将分享在 SDXL 上从零开始训练 T2I-Adapters 的发现、一些令人眼前一亮的结果，当然，还有适用于各种条件输入（草图、canny、线稿、深度和 openpose）的 T2I-Adapter 检查点！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3212308f96cb4f9",
      "translationZh": "与先前版本的 T2I-Adapter（SD-1.4/1.5）相比，T2I-Adapter-SDXL 仍沿用原有方案，用一个 79M 的 Adapter 驱动 2.6B 的 SDXL！T2I-Adapter-SDXL 在继承 SDXL 高质量生成能力的同时，保持了强大的控制能力！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f0a1b920a7673ebb",
      "translationZh": "使用 diffusers 训练 T2I-Adapter-SDXL",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e936a78b3330941",
      "translationZh": "我们的训练脚本基于 diffusers 提供的这个官方示例构建。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38813f65528b14f5",
      "translationZh": "本博文中提到的大多数 T2I-Adapter 模型，都是使用来自 LAION-Aesthetics V2 的 3M 个高分辨率图文对，按照以下设置训练的：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ac8ad8fdd4e65da",
      "translationZh": "训练步数：20000-35000",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "94ccd648a19626f8",
      "translationZh": "批大小：采用数据并行，单 GPU 批大小为 16，总批大小为 128。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f2fbc21e6cf84ec5",
      "translationZh": "学习率：使用恒定学习率 1e-5。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "32cf2e84360f150f",
      "translationZh": "混合精度：fp16",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b63d838c2d5cda5e",
      "translationZh": "我们鼓励社区使用我们的脚本来训练定制且强大的 T2I-Adapters，在速度、内存和质量之间取得具有竞争力的权衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8062123d9cc12043",
      "translationZh": "在 diffusers 中使用 T2I-Adapter-SDXL",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05072d68d4f20ffb",
      "translationZh": "这里，我们以线稿条件为例，演示 T2I-Adapter-SDXL 的用法。首先，安装所需的依赖项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f75ab85504f113c",
      "translationZh": "T2I-Adapter-SDXL 的生成过程主要包括以下两个步骤：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8e7c2dc268aa25c",
      "translationZh": "首先，将条件图像处理为适当的控制图像格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "119def8c36577aca",
      "translationZh": "将控制图像和提示词传入 StableDiffusionXLAdapterPipeline。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdfea9055bde810e",
      "translationZh": "让我们来看一个使用 Lineart Adapter 的简单示例。首先，初始化用于 SDXL 的 T2I-Adapter 管线和线稿检测器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f35f851749212f6d",
      "translationZh": "然后，加载一张图像以检测线稿：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1ad1b07b66ff363",
      "translationZh": "然后我们进行生成：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d26b7d280f2efa11",
      "translationZh": "有两个重要参数需要了解，它们可以帮助你控制条件作用的程度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6faf430f7a0f9af",
      "translationZh": "此参数控制条件对输入的影响程度。值越高，条件作用越强，反之亦然。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64b32c130182f89c",
      "translationZh": "此参数控制在生成过程的最初多少个步骤中应用条件。该值应设在 0-1 之间（默认值为 1）。adapter_conditioning_factor=1 表示应在所有时间步应用适配器，而 adapter_conditioning_factor=0.5 表示仅在前 50% 的步骤中应用适配器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc9b2958348427e5",
      "translationZh": "如需了解更多详情，欢迎查阅官方文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "436cb8249c30267a",
      "translationZh": "试用演示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92d06bc8a042dac6",
      "translationZh": "你可以在这个 Space 中或下方嵌入的交互体验区中轻松试用 T2I-Adapter-SDXL：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d57b11b578605df",
      "translationZh": "你也可以试用 Doodly，它基于草图模型构建，能将你的涂鸦转化为逼真的图像（借助语言监督）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5df5dae415fd21d1",
      "translationZh": "更多结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "545b348114c0cbe1",
      "translationZh": "下面，我们展示了使用不同类型的条件所获得的结果。我们还为这些结果附上了对应的预训练检查点链接。它们的模型卡包含有关训练方式的更多细节，以及使用示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8ba9060586f1917b",
      "translationZh": "线稿引导",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
